Copyright (c) 2026 NebelKrähe. All rights reserved except as granted below.

This repository is licensed in two parts, because two different things live
here and they want opposite freedoms. The standards are meant to be cited,
quoted, and conformed to — and NOT forked into divergent variants that carry
the same name. The instruments are meant to be run by strangers who owe this
desk nothing, which only works if they are free to take them.

